# Spin up Postgres in Docker
Output "03-docker-postgres.gif"
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "yaak run postgres in docker with password mysecret on port 5433"
Enter
Sleep 3s

# Confirm execution
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 3s
